==Battleground==
*4 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pterowl Hazuku]] spawns as the boss after 48.67 seconds<sup>1,460f</sup>.
*4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 48.67 seconds<sup>1,460f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 48.67 seconds<sup>1,460f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Finishing off all Coffin Zoges before boss spawn will make it a lot easier—any one left will be extremely annoying when fighting Pterowl Hazuku with fast peons coming along them. Using [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] is recommended, just be careful of the 200% Wild Doges. Try to kill Hazuku before Formicidaean Ariant appears, as their short burrow distance will make it attack inside Hazuku's blindspot killing your units there and letting Hazuku push.

